  "summary": "FireConnect is a CLI that routes AI coding harnesses (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Pi, Cursor, VS Code Chat, DeepSeek Harness) through Fireworks by rewriting each tool's own config, with on/off/status commands, model mapping, usage metering, and Azure/Foundry support. Evidence coverage: 131 of 140 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
